    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>14级 蛮战</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 元素界 类人生物（恶魔）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 173；''重伤'' 86</span><span>''先攻'' +10</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 26，''强韧'' 28，''反射'' 25，''意志'' 24</span><span>''侦查'' +9</span></div>\n<div><span>''抗力'' 15 可变（每遭遇两次）</span><span></span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span></span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}爪击✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+17 vs. AC<br>命中：2d10+6 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}擒拿✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：+15 vs. 反射<br>命中：2d6+6 伤害，且目标被擒抱。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">次要动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}剔骨爪✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>以一个被该深渊剔骨魔擒抱的生物为目标；无攻击骰；6 点伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（从左往右：深渊剔骨魔，血渗魔）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''技能'' 运动+18</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 23（+13）</span><span>''敏捷'' 17（+10）</span><span>''感知'' 15（+9）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 23（+13）</span><span>''智力'' 7（+5）</span><span>''魅力'' 11（+7）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 混乱邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 深渊语</span></div></div>\n</div>",
